<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Coding<sp/>conventions</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>C++20.<sp/>Build<sp/>with<sp/>`-Wall<sp/>-Wextra<sp/>-pedantic`;<sp/>do<sp/>not<sp/>introduce<sp/>new<sp/>warnings.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Formatting<sp/>is<sp/>defined<sp/>by<sp/>`.clang-format`<sp/>(LLVM-derived,<sp/>4-space<sp/>indent,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>brace-on-next-line<sp/>for<sp/>functions).<sp/>Run<sp/>`clang-format<sp/>-i`<sp/>on<sp/>touched<sp/>files.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`.clang-tidy`<sp/>configures<sp/>static<sp/>analysis;<sp/>address<sp/>findings<sp/>in<sp/>code<sp/>you<sp/>touch.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>`compile_commands.json`<sp/>is<sp/>generated<sp/>for<sp/>clangd;<sp/>editor<sp/>configs<sp/>for<sp/>VS<sp/>Code</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>and<sp/>Zed<sp/>are<sp/>included<sp/>under<sp/>`.vscode/`<sp/>and<sp/>`.zed/`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Documentation<sp/>conventions</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">All<sp/>public<sp/>and<sp/>private<sp/>declarations<sp/>are<sp/>documented<sp/>with<sp/>Doxygen<sp/>`/**<sp/>...<sp/>*/`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">blocks<sp/>so<sp/>`doxygen<sp/>Doxyfile`<sp/>produces<sp/>a<sp/>complete<sp/>reference.<sp/>Follow<sp/>these<sp/>rules:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Document<sp/>intent,<sp/>not<sp/>syntax.**<sp/>Explain<sp/>*why*<sp/>a<sp/>lock,<sp/>branch,<sp/>or<sp/>type<sp/>is</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>needed,<sp/>not<sp/>that<sp/>the<sp/>line<sp/>increments<sp/>a<sp/>counter.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Complete<sp/>contracts.**<sp/>Each<sp/>function<sp/>documents<sp/>parameters<sp/>(`@param[in]`,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>`@param[out]`,<sp/>`@param[in,out]`),<sp/>return<sp/>value<sp/>(`@return`),<sp/>side<sp/>effects,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>pre/postconditions,<sp/>exceptions<sp/>(`@throws`),<sp/>and<sp/>thread-safety<sp/>or<sp/>ownership</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>requirements<sp/>where<sp/>they<sp/>are<sp/>known.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>**Evidence<sp/>only.**<sp/>Never<sp/>invent<sp/>behaviour,<sp/>guarantees,<sp/>or<sp/>exceptions.<sp/>If<sp/>a</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>property<sp/>cannot<sp/>be<sp/>established<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>implementation,<sp/>say<sp/>so<sp/>explicitly.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">4.<sp/>**Preserve<sp/>accurate<sp/>existing<sp/>comments.**<sp/>Correct<sp/>them<sp/>only<sp/>when<sp/>the<sp/>code</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>provides<sp/>clear<sp/>evidence.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">5.<sp/>**Classes**<sp/>carry<sp/>`@class`<sp/>and<sp/>`@brief`<sp/>plus<sp/>a<sp/>`@details`<sp/>paragraph<sp/>covering</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>responsibility,<sp/>lifecycle,<sp/>ownership<sp/>and<sp/>thread-safety.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">6.<sp/>**Members<sp/>and<sp/>non-obvious<sp/>locals**<sp/>get<sp/>a<sp/>short<sp/>comment<sp/>explaining<sp/>what<sp/>they</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>represent<sp/>and<sp/>why<sp/>they<sp/>exist;<sp/>do<sp/>not<sp/>add<sp/>comments<sp/>that<sp/>merely<sp/>restate<sp/>code.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">7.<sp/>**Ownership<sp/>and<sp/>concurrency<sp/>matter.**<sp/>Call<sp/>out<sp/>`unique_ptr`<sp/>vs<sp/>`shared_ptr`,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>borrowed<sp/>references,<sp/>`std::move`,<sp/>`const`<sp/>correctness,<sp/>atomic<sp/>memory</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>ordering,<sp/>and<sp/>lock<sp/>ordering<sp/>wherever<sp/>they<sp/>affect<sp/>maintenance.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Shell<sp/>scripts</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Shell<sp/>scripts<sp/>under<sp/>`scripts/`,<sp/>`tools/`,<sp/>`docker/`,<sp/>`.github/`<sp/>and<sp/>the</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">repository<sp/>root<sp/>use<sp/>the<sp/>same<sp/>header<sp/>fields,<sp/>written<sp/>as<sp/>`#`-prefixed<sp/>lines</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">immediately<sp/>after<sp/>the<sp/>shebang<sp/>(`@file`,<sp/>`@brief`,<sp/>`@author`,<sp/>`@date`),<sp/>plus</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`#<sp/>@brief`<sp/>/<sp/>`#<sp/>@param`<sp/>blocks<sp/>above<sp/>each<sp/>function<sp/>and<sp/>`#`<sp/>WHY<sp/>comments<sp/>for</highlight></codeline>
