<codeline><highlight class="normal">of<sp/>the<sp/>Doxygen<sp/>`INPUT`;<sp/>they<sp/>are<sp/>documented<sp/>in-source<sp/>and<sp/>read<sp/>directly.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
