<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Build<sp/>and<sp/>test</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Dependencies<sp/>are<sp/>managed<sp/>with<sp/>Conan<sp/>and<sp/>pinned<sp/>in<sp/>`conan.lock`.<sp/>Typical<sp/>local</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">flow<sp/>(see<sp/>`README.md`<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>full,<sp/>platform-specific<sp/>sequence):</highlight></codeline>
