<codeline><highlight class="normal">conan<sp/>install<sp/>.<sp/>--build=missing<sp/>-s<sp/>build_type=Debug<sp/>-of<sp/>build/Debug</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--preset<sp/>conan-debug</highlight></codeline>
